refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
public Time\DurationTime\Duration::add Time\Durationduration
Returns the sum of this duration and duration. The signs of both durations are taken into account, so adding a negative duration shortens a positive one.

  &reftitle.examples;

   Time\Duration::add example


<?php
$total = Time\Duration::fromMinutes(1)
    ->add(Time\Duration::fromSeconds(30))
    ->add(Time\Duration::fromMilliseconds(500));

var_dump($total);

// Adding a negative duration subtracts it.
var_dump(Time\Duration::fromSeconds(10)->add(Time\Duration::fromSeconds(4)->negate())->seconds);


